  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "4014901",
      "subQuestName": "等待至次日的6时至8时",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401490101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401490101": {
            "id": "401490101",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "…时间过得可真快啊。我这手也好得差不多了，明天开始，应该就能重新掌勺了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490102"
            ]
          },
          "401490102": {
            "id": "401490102",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "#这阵子真是辛苦你了，{NICKNAME}。但愿这最后一天，也能安安稳稳地度过。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490103"
            ]
          },
          "401490103": {
            "id": "401490103",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "呃，你这话一说，我就感觉又有事要发生…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490104"
            ]
          },
          "401490104": {
            "id": "401490104",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "一日无事…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490105"
            ]
          },
          "401490105": {
            "id": "401490105",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "呼——普普通通地到晚上了呢，结果真没出什么岔子…嗯，肯定是因为我们已经完全熟练了吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490106"
            ]
          },
          "401490106": {
            "id": "401490106",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "记得第一天上工的时候，连加盐加辣都要记上半天…现在不管发生什么，都只是「小菜一碟」啦！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490109"
            ]
          },
          "401490109": {
            "id": "401490109",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "都这个时候了，不会再来人了吧？呃…不对，第一天林尼他们来的时候，好像也是这个点…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490110"
            ]
          },
          "401490110": {
            "id": "401490110",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "安柏",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}？派蒙？好久不见！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490111"
            ]
          },
          "401490111": {
            "id": "401490111",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "安柏？还有优菈和米卡！你们是来吃饭的吗，怎么这么晚？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490112"
            ]
          },
          "401490112": {
            "id": "401490112",
            "speakerId": 1060,
            "speakerName": "米卡",
            "text": "我们刚完成了护卫商队的任务，还在返回石门的路上。虽然原计划是想直接吃些便携口粮就继续赶路…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490113"
            ]
          },
          "401490113": {
            "id": "401490113",
            "speakerId": 1060,
            "speakerName": "米卡",
            "text": "不过优菈队长说，很久没吃璃月菜了，不如顺道来这间客栈，看看还能不能点餐。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490114"
            ]
          },
          "401490114": {
            "id": "401490114",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸，居然是优菈的提议吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490115"
            ]
          },
          "401490115": {
            "id": "401490115",
            "speakerId": 1029,
            "speakerName": "优菈",
            "text": "…咳！这一路过来吃的都是便携口粮…偶尔也得换下口味吧！怎么了，不行吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014902",
      "subQuestName": "与言笑对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014906",
      "subQuestName": "与言笑对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401490401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401490401": {
            "id": "401490401",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "「随便」…唉，这对厨师来说，大概是最头疼的要求了。完全不知道客人的好恶，只能靠自己推测…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490402"
            ]
          },
          "401490402": {
            "id": "401490402",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "不过这么多天看下来，我相信你一定能选出最合适的答案，就「随便」给他们露一手吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490403"
            ]
          },
          "401490403": {
            "id": "401490403",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（想一想…他们现在最想吃的会是什么…对他们来说最可能喜欢的菜是什么…）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014903",
      "subQuestName": "烹制「随便做点」",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401490301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401490301": {
            "id": "401490301",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "淮安",
            "text": "#哟！{NICKNAME}，这些天真是辛苦你们了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490302"
            ]
          },
          "401490302": {
            "id": "401490302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "不辛苦，我有工资的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490303"
            ]
          },
          "401490303": {
            "id": "401490303",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "淮安",
            "text": "哈哈，真是个实在人。拿着吧，在之前的基础上，还多添了一些报酬，毕竟多劳多得嘛！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490304"
            ]
          },
          "401490304": {
            "id": "401490304",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "好耶！感觉几天的疲惫一下子就消失了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490305"
            ]
          },
          "401490305": {
            "id": "401490305",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "才几天就能进步到这水准，要是接着干下去，我怕是要把这厨房让给你了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490306"
            ]
          },
          "401490306": {
            "id": "401490306",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我还想继续吃你做的菜呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490307"
            ]
          },
          "401490307": {
            "id": "401490307",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "嘿，好说，下次过来记得带上朋友一起，让他们也尝尝我的手艺！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490308"
            ]
          },
          "401490308": {
            "id": "401490308",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "在那之前，你可别再烫着手啦！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014904",
      "subQuestName": "为等待已久的蒙德一行人上菜",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401490201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401490201": {
            "id": "401490201",
            "speakerId": 1060,
            "speakerName": "米卡",
            "text": "…好香，咸味跟鲜味都恰到好处，每一粒米都有味道！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490202"
            ]
          },
          "401490202": {
            "id": "401490202",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "安柏",
            "text": "刚出锅时恰到好处的热气，也很让人怀念呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490203"
            ]
          },
          "401490203": {
            "id": "401490203",
            "speakerId": 1029,
            "speakerName": "优菈",
            "text": "哼哼，能让「骑士团最好的军粮」都相形见绌…报上名吧，这道菜叫什么名字？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490204"
            ]
          },
          "401490204": {
            "id": "401490204",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "叫…叫——总不能真叫「随便做点」吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490205"
            ]
          },
          "401490205": {
            "id": "401490205",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "…连名字都没有，用料跟做法也很普通，根本不知道从哪开始介绍啊？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490206"
            ]
          },
          "401490206": {
            "id": "401490206",
            "speakerId": 1060,
            "speakerName": "米卡",
            "text": "用料和做法都很普通吗？我还以为一定是用了什么特别的食材，或者特别的手法…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401490209"
            ]
          },
          "401490209": {
            "id": "401490209",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "不是「最美味」，而是「最合适」…是、是什么意思啊？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014905",
      "subQuestName": "与言笑对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014992",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401499201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401499201": {
            "id": "401499201",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "油、盐、酱、醋…嗯，储备都很充足，够用过这阵了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014993",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401499301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401499301": {
            "id": "401499301",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "淮安",
            "text": "#哟，{NICKNAME}，今年算是开了个好头呀。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014994",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401499401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401499401": {
            "id": "401499401",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "安柏",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401499402"
            ]
          },
          "401499402": {
            "id": "401499402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "安柏？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401499403"
            ]
          },
          "401499403": {
            "id": "401499403",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "安柏",
            "text": "…啊，抱歉，没注意到你来了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401499404"
            ]
          },
          "401499404": {
            "id": "401499404",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你在想事情吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401499405"
            ]
          },
          "401499405": {
            "id": "401499405",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "安柏",
            "text": "嗯，刚才那顿饭，有点像是我爷爷给我做过的…我都以为自己快要忘记这种味道了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401499406"
            ]
          },
          "401499406": {
            "id": "401499406",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "安柏",
            "text": "爷爷以前经常做璃月菜。每次跟他一起训练到晚上，我都会守在餐桌旁边…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401499407"
            ]
          },
          "401499407": {
            "id": "401499407",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "安柏",
            "text": "一边闻着香气，一边盼着爷爷从厨房出来。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401499408"
            ]
          },
          "401499408": {
            "id": "401499408",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "安柏",
            "text": "有时候优菈也会来，虽然嘴上一直抱怨不停，但吃得却很开心。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401499411"
            ]
          },
          "401499411": {
            "id": "401499411",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "安柏",
            "text": "…最好别去问她哦，不然她肯定又要怨你啦！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014995",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401499501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401499501": {
            "id": "401499501",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "看你的表情，是已经决定了吧？就「随便」给他们露一手吧！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014996",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401499601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401499601": {
            "id": "401499601",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "安柏",
            "text": "抱歉，实在想不出有什么想吃的…与其胡乱点一道菜，还是交给你比较放心吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401499602"
            ]
          },
          "401499602": {
            "id": "401499602",
            "speakerId": 1029,
            "speakerName": "优菈",
            "text": "啊，虽然说了随便…不过酒就不用上了，他们俩都喝不了…唉，真可惜。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401499603"
            ]
          },
          "401499603": {
            "id": "401499603",
            "speakerId": 1060,
            "speakerName": "米卡",
            "text": "我…我这里还有一些气泡水！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014997",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401499701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401499701": {
            "id": "401499701",
            "speakerId": 1060,
            "speakerName": "米卡",
            "text": "跟随大团长远征的时候，我也经常负责生火做饭。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401499702"
            ]
          },
          "401499702": {
            "id": "401499702",
            "speakerId": 1060,
            "speakerName": "米卡",
            "text": "虽然很多时候限于条件，没办法做得精细…不过大家吃得也都很高兴。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401499703"
            ]
          },
          "401499703": {
            "id": "401499703",
            "speakerId": 1060,
            "speakerName": "米卡",
            "text": "现在想起来，也是因为「心意」吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014998",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401499801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401499801": {
            "id": "401499801",
            "speakerId": 1029,
            "speakerName": "优菈",
            "text": "我们随身携带的口粮，是从我拿手的「月亮派」改造来的，能胜过它…不得不说，干得不错！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401499802"
            ]
          },
          "401499802": {
            "id": "401499802",
            "speakerId": 1029,
            "speakerName": "优菈",
            "text": "…不过下次来蒙德，记得尝尝我做的原版。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}